            "review_text": "Colline V\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam45 contributions\n0\nI won’t come back\nMay 2018 • Couples\nThey asked me to choose crab types. Prices were quite high a bit while crabs was small. We ordered 2 dishes Tamarind Crabs; Salt and pepper Crabs. But I have admitted that nothing special from both of dishes.\nWith this price I think I can find another plates with better taste.\n\nNice decoration for selfie but it’s not worth.\nRead more\nWritten September 6, 2018\nVăn N\nWe are really sorry for bringing you a bad experience. We will change and will definitely make you satisfied if you have opportunity to come back.\nThanking you\nRead more\nWritten December 17, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
